abstract: >-
  An open standards activity under development, with a computational
  implementation pathway: the OG-CAIE process, its vocabulary grounded in
  ISO 9000:2026, SEVOCAB, NIST AI 700-2 and W3C canon, the human and machine
  assemblage that runs it modeled in SysML v2, and one evaluation record
  whose conformity is checked by machine and whose judgments are attested by
  named people. A collaboration between Dynamical Systems Group and Humane
  Intelligence.
